# Check every text file out with LF on every OS. Parser, binder and config fixtures are
# compared byte for byte (spans are byte offsets), so a CRLF checkout on Windows would change
# them. No fixture needs CRLF today; one that does must be marked `-text` here.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.wasm binary
*.gz binary
*.tgz binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
